title: Angler
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<if $day == 1>>
    <<jump Angler_Day1>>
<<elseif $day == 2>>
    <<jump Angler_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 3>>
    <<jump Angler_Day3>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Angler_Day1
---
Angler: Hey Ernest. There's a lot of fish in here! You should come by the lake later.
<<if $talkedToAngler == false>>
    <<set $talkedToAngler = true>>
    <<set $peopleMet = $peopleMet + 1>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Angler_Day2
---
Angler: Did you really believe that story last night? 
Angler: What if there really is a wolf out there? And it comes to eat us all in the night! 
    -> Ernest: That's impossible, wolves don't eat people 
    -> Ernest: It was just a myth
Angler: I guess you're right. I'm worried over nothing. 
===

title: Angler_Day3
---
Angler: Hello Ernest, I heard you were on lunch duty. Lucky for you, I saw some fish swimming in the water earlier.  
Angler: Have you ever used a fishing rod before?
    -> Ernest: Yes
    -> Ernest: No
Angler: You should see if you can catch any.   
<<if $hasFished == false>>
    <<set $hasFished = true>>
<<endif>>
<<set $playFishing = true>>
===
